    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "① 消费积压",
      "description": "AIMD 闭环的第一环：下游跟不上时积压先涨。\n\n这三张图刻意分开画、不做双轴 —— 积压（万级）、放行阈值（万级 req/s）、P99（毫秒）三个量纲放一张图必须配两三个 Y 轴，而双轴的刻度对齐是任意的，会凭空造出一个数据里没有的相关性。分开画 + 共享时间光标，因果关系照样读得出来，而且不骗人。",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "stream_pending",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "积压条数"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 18,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "pointSize": 8,
            "spanNulls": true,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "axisSoftMin": 0,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            },
            "axisLabel": "",
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            }
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "积压条数"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#d95926"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": false,
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
