    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "② 放行阈值（L0 AIMD 的反应）",
      "description": "第二环：积压涨 → 乘性收紧放行。把光标停在上一张图积压的爬升段，这条线应该正在往下走。\n\n第一版的判据看积压**水位**而不是**趋势**，而控制周期 1 秒、积压排空要几十秒 —— 执行器比被控对象快 30 倍，于是对着一个已经在下降的信号疯狂过度修正，阈值被砍了 73 倍、误拒率 99.2%。改成趋势判据后成交 +27.7% 而 P99 基本不变。",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "control_limit_qps",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "limit.qps"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "decimals": 0,
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 18,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "pointSize": 8,
            "spanNulls": true,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "axisSoftMin": 0,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            },
            "axisLabel": "",
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            }
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "limit.qps"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#3987e5"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": false,
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "sort": "none"
